  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Afsar vs State Of U P And Another on 18 November, 2024 Bench: Anjani Kumar Mishra, Jayant Banerji High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:179988-Db Court No. - 3 Case :- Writ - C No. - 37828 of 2024 Petitioner :- Afsar Respondent :- State Of U P And Another Counsel for Petitioner :- Akhilesh Kumar Pandey Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C.,Saurabh Tiwari Hon'ble Anjani Kumar Mishra,J. Hon'ble Jayant Banerji,J. 1.",
    "facts": "The so-called representation in fact appears to be an application for grant of a license for sale of meat. 3. It has been submitted by counsel for the respondent no. 2 that the Nagar Palika Parishad only has right to issue a 'no objection certificate'. The license itself is to be granted under the Food Safety Standards Act, 2006 by the competent authority therein. On a query by the Court, it is admitted that no decision as regards grant of 'no objection certificate' which alone the Nagar Palika Parishad can grant has taken till date.",
